@bank all
// ZW1 (writer), patch 0.92.3 items 21 and 24: the small repairs on the job board (FX10's FIX_ROWS, section 17;
// keys and places from content/works/keys-fix.md). TEXTS, said by nobody. title: the board card, an order of about
// 40 characters at most, no deck numbers, no tool (the game says the tool). sign: what you notice when you arrive.
// done: what's different now. One line per key.

// ---- Watch office (deck 2)
== fix.wo-screen.title
- Reseat a flickering watch screen
== fix.wo-screen.sign
- The left watch screen blinks off for a second, then back on.
== fix.wo-screen.done
- Steady picture. Not a blink.
== fix.wo-chair.title
- Tighten a wobbly watch chair
== fix.wo-chair.sign
- The chair rocks every time someone leans back.
== fix.wo-chair.done
- Firm as a rock.
== fix.wo-blind.title
- Free a stuck glass blind
== fix.wo-blind.sign
- The blind on the glass wall is stuck halfway, at a tilt.
== fix.wo-blind.done
- Up and down, smooth all the way.
== fix.wo-lamp.title
- Replace the watch office desk lamp
== fix.wo-lamp.sign
- The desk lamp stays dark, whichever way you click it.
== fix.wo-lamp.done
- A warm pool of light on the desk again.
== fix.wo-jack.title
- Rewire a crackling headset jack
== fix.wo-jack.sign
- The headset crackles whenever its lead moves.
== fix.wo-jack.done
- Clean sound. No crackle.
== fix.wo-vent.title
- Clear a rattling ceiling vent
== fix.wo-vent.sign
- The vent above the desks rattles like a loose tooth.
== fix.wo-vent.done
- Just the quiet hush of the air.
== fix.wo-clock.title
- Reset the drifting watch clock
== fix.wo-clock.sign
- The wall clock is four minutes ahead of everyone's devices.
== fix.wo-clock.done
- On ship time, to the second.

// ---- Chart room (deck 2)
== fix.cr-table.title
- Replace the chart table backlight
== fix.cr-table.sign
- One corner of the chart table has gone dark.
== fix.cr-table.done
- The whole table glows evenly now.
== fix.cr-drawer.title
- Free a jammed chart drawer
== fix.cr-drawer.sign
- A wide drawer under the table won't open past a finger's width.
== fix.cr-drawer.done
- It slides out and back without a fight.
== fix.cr-plotter.title
- Fit a new bearing in the plotter arm
== fix.cr-plotter.sign
- The plotter arm grinds as it sweeps across the table.
== fix.cr-plotter.done
- The arm glides. You can barely hear it.
== fix.cr-projector.title
- Realign the star projector
== fix.cr-projector.sign
- The stars on the ceiling are smeared and a little off true.
== fix.cr-projector.done
- Sharp, bright stars, right where they belong.
== fix.cr-shelf.title
- Fix a sagging chart shelf
== fix.cr-shelf.sign
- The top shelf dips in the middle under its rolls of charts.
== fix.cr-shelf.done
- Level again, and the charts sit straight.
== fix.cr-seat.title
- Fix a loose window-seat hinge
== fix.cr-seat.sign
- The window seat's lid drops with a bang when you lift it.
== fix.cr-seat.done
- The lid opens and stays open.
== fix.cr-reading.title
- Replace a window reading lamp
== fix.cr-reading.sign
- The reading lamp by the window flickers, then gives up.
== fix.cr-reading.done
- Good light to read by again.
== fix.cr-hum.title
- Find the hum in the sockets
== fix.cr-hum.sign
- A low hum comes from the wall sockets by the door.
== fix.cr-hum.done
- Found it, fixed it. Quiet.

// ---- Survey lab (deck 2)
== fix.sl-fume.title
- Fit a new fume hood fan belt
== fix.sl-fume.sign
- The fume hood fan squeals and slows when it's switched on.
== fix.sl-fume.done
- The fan spins up quietly and pulls well.
== fix.sl-spectro.title
- Realign a spectrometer mount
== fix.sl-spectro.sign
- The spectrometer's readings wander when the bench is touched.
== fix.sl-spectro.done
- Steady readings, even with a nudge.
== fix.sl-tap.title
- Fix a dripping lab tap
== fix.sl-tap.sign
- The tap at the sink drips, slow and steady.
== fix.sl-tap.done
- Not a drop.
== fix.sl-socket.title
- Reset a tripped bench socket
== fix.sl-socket.sign
- Half the bench has no power; its socket light is off.
== fix.sl-socket.done
- Power back along the bench.
== fix.sl-stool.title
- Tighten a wobbly lab stool
== fix.sl-stool.sign
- One stool lurches whenever someone sits on it.
== fix.sl-stool.done
- Sits square on all four feet.
== fix.sl-lamp.title
- Replace a buzzing bench lamp
== fix.sl-lamp.sign
- A bench lamp buzzes and glows a dull orange.
== fix.sl-lamp.done
- Bright, white and quiet.
== fix.sl-screen.title
- Replace a frayed screen cable
== fix.sl-screen.sign
- The bench screen's cable is frayed where it bends.
== fix.sl-screen.done
- A new cable, neatly clipped in.
== fix.sl-eyewash.title
- Fix the eyewash station valve
== fix.sl-eyewash.sign
- The eyewash gives a weak, spluttering trickle when tested.
== fix.sl-eyewash.done
- A good, even stream. Ready if it's needed.
== fix.sl-cabinet.title
- Adjust a sticking cabinet door
== fix.sl-cabinet.sign
- A cabinet door catches on its frame and has to be yanked.
== fix.sl-cabinet.done
- It swings shut with a soft click.
== fix.sl-centrifuge.title
- Fit a bearing in a whining centrifuge
== fix.sl-centrifuge.sign
- The centrifuge whines higher and higher as it spins up.
== fix.sl-centrifuge.done
- It spins up with a low, even hum.
== fix.sl-gastap.title
- Reseal a hissing gas tap
== fix.sl-gastap.sign
- A faint hiss comes from the bench gas tap, even when it's off.
== fix.sl-gastap.done
- Off means off. No hiss.
== fix.sl-hoodlamp.title
- Replace a fume hood lamp
== fix.sl-hoodlamp.sign
- The light inside the fume hood is out.
== fix.sl-hoodlamp.done
- The hood's lit, end to end.
== fix.sl-balance.title
- Level and zero a lab balance
== fix.sl-balance.sign
- The balance reads a few milligrams with nothing on it.
== fix.sl-balance.done
- Zero, and it stays at zero.

// ---- Sample lab (deck 2)
== fix.sm-fridge.title
- Replace a sample fridge door seal
== fix.sm-fridge.sign
- The fridge door seal has split, and frost is creeping in.
== fix.sm-fridge.done
- The door shuts snug. No more frost.
== fix.sm-freezer.title
- Stop a freezer alarm going off
== fix.sm-freezer.sign
- The freezer alarm beeps, but the freezer's as cold as ever.
== fix.sm-freezer.done
- The alarm stays quiet, as it should.
== fix.sm-glovebox.title
- Change a split glove on the glove box
== fix.sm-glovebox.sign
- One glove on the glove box has a split at the thumb.
== fix.sm-glovebox.done
- A new glove, sealed tight.
== fix.sm-scope.title
- Replace a microscope lamp
== fix.sm-scope.sign
- The microscope's light flickers under the slide.
== fix.sm-scope.done
- A clear, bright field.
== fix.sm-sink.title
- Clear a slow lab sink
== fix.sm-sink.sign
- Water sits in the sink and drains away very slowly.
== fix.sm-sink.done
- It drains in seconds now.
== fix.sm-rack.title
- Fix a rattling sample rack
== fix.sm-rack.sign
- The sample rack rattles every time a drawer closes.
== fix.sm-rack.done
- Everything sits still in the rack.
== fix.sm-printer.title
- Repair a label printer cable
== fix.sm-printer.sign
- The label printer cuts out halfway through a label.
== fix.sm-printer.done
- Labels print clean, start to finish.
== fix.sm-cleanbench.title
- Fit a new clean bench fan belt
== fix.sm-cleanbench.sign
- The clean bench fan slips and flutters.
== fix.sm-cleanbench.done
- A steady, quiet draught across the bench.
== fix.sm-panel.title
- Replace a flickering ceiling panel
== fix.sm-panel.sign
- A ceiling panel over the benches flickers on and off.
== fix.sm-panel.done
- Even light across the lab.
== fix.sm-incubator.title
- Recalibrate a drifting incubator
== fix.sm-incubator.sign
- The incubator reads half a degree warmer than its setting.
== fix.sm-incubator.done
- Right on its setting.

// ---- Comms room (deck 2)
== fix.cm-card.title
- Reseat a loose console card
== fix.cm-card.sign
- One console channel drops out now and then.
== fix.cm-card.done
- Every channel holds.
== fix.cm-lead.title
- Rewire a headset lead
== fix.cm-lead.sign
