== fix.cm-lead.done
- Clear sound, however the lead lies.
== fix.cm-chair.title
- Fix a comms chair that sinks
== fix.cm-chair.sign
- One chair slowly sinks until the person in it is at knee height.
== fix.cm-chair.done
- It stays at the height you set.
== fix.cm-patch.title
- Replace a patch panel lead
== fix.cm-patch.sign
- One lead in the patch panel is kinked and warm.
== fix.cm-patch.done
- A fresh lead, neatly routed.
== fix.cm-fan.title
- Quiet a buzzing rack fan
== fix.cm-fan.sign
- The rack fan buzzes like a trapped wasp.
== fix.cm-fan.done
- Just a soft whirr now.
== fix.cm-booth.title
- Reseal the quiet booth door
== fix.cm-booth.sign
- Voices from the room leak into the quiet booth.
== fix.cm-booth.done
- Door shut, booth quiet.
== fix.cm-lamp.title
- Replace the comms room desk lamp
== fix.cm-lamp.sign
- The desk lamp at the end station is dead.
== fix.cm-lamp.done
- Light on the desk again.
== fix.cm-screen.title
- Realign a call-home screen
== fix.cm-screen.sign
- The call screen's picture sits crooked and slightly blurred.
== fix.cm-screen.done
- Straight, sharp and ready for a call home.
== fix.cm-mic.title
- Fix a crackling microphone arm
== fix.cm-mic.sign
- The desk microphone crackles when its arm is moved.
== fix.cm-mic.done
- Move it anywhere. Not a crackle.
== fix.cm-clocks.title
- Set the wall clocks to ship time
== fix.cm-clocks.sign
- The wall clocks disagree by a minute or two.
== fix.cm-clocks.done
- Every clock on ship time.

